#   Auto-Compactor makes (None = nothing to compact), smelt = the Auto-Smelt Pole's output + its Enchanted form, worker = the starter
#   worker totem, bonus = the rare find of the shard's bonus totems (Harvest Moon / Sap Tap / Geode Pole / Trophy Pole) + its collection
#   credit multiplier + XP, upg = the item storage tiers / the Auto-Compactor cost (0.2's Enchanted Wheat for Farming), grow = the item a
#   Grow costs (medium qty, large qty; Farming keeps its grow.medium.seeds / grow.large.seeds rows). PLACEHOLDER numbers (question 2).
